  "body": "Fixes #3312 \n\nThe first example of the output element incorrectly referenced input elements in the `for` attribute by their names:\n\n```html\n<form onsubmit=\"return false\" oninput=\"o.value = a.valueAsNumber + b.valueAsNumber\">\n <input name=a type=number step=any> +\n <input name=b type=number step=any> =\n <output name=o for=\"a b\"></output>\n</form>\n```\n\nI added IDs to the input elements and used them in the `for` attribute. The example looks like this now:\n\n```html\n<form onsubmit=\"return false\" oninput=\"o.value = a.valueAsNumber + b.valueAsNumber\">\n <input id=\"number-a\" name=a type=number step=any> +\n <input id=\"number-b\" name=b type=number step=any> =\n <output name=o for=\"number-a number-b\"></output>\n</form>\n```\n\nAnother option would be to only use IDs:\n\n```html\n<form onsubmit=\"return false\" oninput=\"o.value = a.valueAsNumber + b.valueAsNumber\">\n <input id=a type=number step=any> +\n <input id=b type=number step=any> =\n <output id=o for=\"a b\"></output>\n</form>\n```\n\nPersonally I prefer the first example with separate names and IDs, though.\n\nPlease let me know if anything is missing or if this fix is wrong entirely.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3313/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 30, 2017, 3:05 PM GMT (87713c5)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3313/ffbe80e...87713c5/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 30, 2017, 3:05 PM GMT (87713c5)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3313/form-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 30, 2017, 3:05 PM GMT (87713c5)\">/form-elements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3313/ffbe80e...87713c5/form-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 30, 2017, 3:05 PM GMT (87713c5)\">diff</a> )",
